printing.color_note = Pikselā sRGB-rūpena pariṇāmenti. Tumhākaṃ PDF-dassako ca muddayantañ ca muddayantassa vaṇṇalakkhaṇaṃ niyāmenti.
printing.sizing_note = Anurūpappamāṇavidhi chāyārūpaṃ ekekasmiṃ jālakoṭṭhāse acchinditvā ṭhapeti. Yathābhūtappamāṇaṃ potthakassa DPI-anusārena hoti; na samāyāti ce jālassa pantiyo vā thambhe vā ūnīkarotha. PDF paṇṇappamāṇānurūpakaraṇaṃ vinā 100% pamāṇena muddayatha.
